{"id":"c4b39c5016bde05b","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-beltprimes.md","title":"Prime implicants and exact count for belt functions","display":"thm-beltprimes — Prime implicants and exact count for belt functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-beltprimes","aliases":["27-thm-beltprimes"],"display":"thm-beltprimes — Prime implicants and exact count for belt functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-beltfunction]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.4.1 Lemma 3.12; Theorem 3.16 proof","source_printed_pages":"160","source_pdf_pages":"184","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-beltprimes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-beltprimes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-beltprimes — Prime implicants and exact count for belt functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6775c3d8129c651\" href=\"?note=d6775c3d8129c651\" title=\"27-df-beltfunction\">27-df-beltfunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.4.1 Lemma 3.12; Theorem 3.16 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"160"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"184"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+k\\le n\">\\(m+k\\le n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{n,m,k}\">\\(b_{n,m,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6775c3d8129c651\" href=\"?note=d6775c3d8129c651\" title=\"27-df-beltfunction\">27-df-beltfunction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。对不交 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,N\\subseteq[n]\">\\(P,N\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{P,N}\">\\(C_{P,N}\\)</span> 是下节构造的项函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{P,N}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(P,N\\subseteq[n],\\ P\\cap N=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{P,N}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(P,N\\subseteq[n],\\ P\\cap N=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})=\\{C_{P,N}\\mid P,N\\subseteq[n]\\land P\\cap N=\\varnothing\\land|P|=m\\land|N|=n-m-k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})=\\{C_{P,N}\\mid P,N\\subseteq[n]\\land P\\cap N=\\varnothing\\land|P|=m\\land|N|=n-m-k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})|=\\binom nm\\binom{n-m}{n-m-k}=\\frac{n!}{m!k!(n-m-k)!}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})|=\\binom nm\\binom{n-m}{n-m-k}=\\frac{n!}{m!k!(n-m-k)!}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一个项覆盖的最低与最高重量分别为 |P| 和 n−|N|，因此是蕴涵项当且仅当它们落在带的两端界之内。若正或负文字数超过相应下界，仍可删文字；恰达两界时每次删文字都会越出真层，故得到精确素性条件。先选 m 个正位置，再选 n−m−k 个负位置即得计数。常一端点得到唯一空项，单层端点得到该层所有满项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-beltfunction","status":"resolved","id":"d6775c3d8129c651","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-beltfunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-beltfunction","status":"resolved","id":"d6775c3d8129c651","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$m+k\\le n$，$b_{n,m,k}$ 见 [[27-df-beltfunction]]；$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。对不交 $P,N\\subseteq[n]$，$C_{P,N}$ 是下节构造的项函数。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$m+k\\le n$，$b_{n,m,k}$ 见 [[27-df-beltfunction]]；$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。对不交 $P,N\\subseteq[n]$，$C_{P,N}$ 是下节构造的项函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m+k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"b_{n,m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"P,N\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"C_{P,N}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{P,N}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in P}a_i\\prod_{j\\in N}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(P,N\\subseteq[n],\\ P\\cap N=\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})=\\{C_{P,N}\\mid P,N\\subseteq[n]\\land P\\cap N=\\varnothing\\land|P|=m\\land|N|=n-m-k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{PI}(b_{n,m,k})|=\\binom nm\\binom{n-m}{n-m-k}=\\frac{n!}{m!k!(n-m-k)!}.","display":true}],"bytes":1858,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-beltprimes|thm-beltprimes — Prime implicants and exact count for belt functions]]"}],"outgoing":["d6775c3d8129c651","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}